{"about_the_game":"Doll Inc is a single-player, first-person narrative simulator set in an automated inspection facility. You take the role of a newly assigned classification operator, responsible for reviewing mechanical dolls on an assembly line and deciding whether they go to production or repair.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe core gameplay revolves around:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspecting each unit for physical or behavioral defects<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScanning barcodes and checking internal data for inconsistencies<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSending each product to the correct destination (repair/production)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFulfilling specific product requests during each shift<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManaging system failures like conveyor jams, power outages, or missing parts<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress through your 30-day trial period, you\u2019ll:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock new tools and upgrades to streamline your work<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore different rooms including Storage, Maintenance, and Surveillance<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFace increasing pressure with tighter deadlines and error penalties<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUncover subtle narrative clues about the factory's true nature<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDoll Inc combines puzzle-solving, time management, and narrative discovery in a tense, immersive environment where every task matters \u2014 and someone is always watching.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722760?t=1747299969","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/63ad50aafbf3cf76e41a0b092d19048eaf14fc39/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747299969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/5fb8c6484355ebe18afc694cbb5d34b3020798d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747299969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/5fb8c6484355ebe18afc694cbb5d34b3020798d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747299969","categories":[{"d